usage: demo_isr_da_comparison.py [-h] [--force] [--no-plot] [--days DAYS]
                                 [--tier {1,2,3}] [--start-date START_DATE]
                                 [--list-days] [--status] [--bin-count COUNT]
                                 [--window HHMM] [--occ-bins LIST]
                                 [--ekf-alpha A] [--ekf-sigma-obs TECU]
                                 [--ekf-max-rays N] [--ekf-tol TOL]
                                 [--ekf-max-iter N] [--ekf-n-members N]
                                 [--ekf-prior-scale S]
                                 [--resume | --no-resume]

Compare KF/EKF data assimilation against ISR ground truth.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --force               Ignore caches and recompute everything.
  --no-plot             Skip figure generation.
  --days DAYS           Limit processing to the first N priority days (after
                        --start-date filtering, if given).
  --tier {1,2,3}        Only process days of this priority tier (1=TRO+ESR,
                        2=either, 3=JRO only). Default: all tiers.
  --start-date START_DATE
                        Begin processing at this date, YYYY-MM-DD (e.g.
                        2025-08-27), in chronological order -- overrides the
                        default tier-then-date priority ordering so
                        earlier/lower-tier days aren't skipped ahead of it.
  --list-days           Print priority-day summary and exit.
  --status              Print resume/progress status (groups completed,
                        filter-run outcomes, ISR metrics CSV size, and a
                        window x bin_count completion grid) and exit without
                        running anything.
  --bin-count COUNT     Run only this OCC_COUNT_BINS value: an int (e.g. 30)
                        or "all" (bin_count=None, every available RO
                        occultation in the window). Overrides --occ-bins.
  --window HHMM         Run only this minima-window, by window_key (e.g.
                        "1430").
  --occ-bins LIST       Comma-separated override of OCC_COUNT_BINS, e.g.
                        "all,30,20,10" (each token an int or "all").
  --ekf-alpha A         Override EKF Gauss-Newton step-size damping in (0,1]
                        (default 0.5).
  --ekf-sigma-obs TECU  Override EKF observation-noise std-dev in TECU
                        (default 10.0).
  --ekf-max-rays N      Override EKF representative update rays per arc
                        (default 100).
  --ekf-tol TOL         Override EKF relative convergence tolerance (default
                        0.0005).
  --ekf-max-iter N      Override EKF max iterations (default 20).
  --ekf-n-members N     Override EKF prior ensemble size factoring the
                        covariance (default 200).
  --ekf-prior-scale S   Multiplier on the EKF prior parameter variances; >1
                        loosens, <1 tightens the background (default 1.0).
  --resume              Skip (window, bin, obs_mode, filter) units already
                        complete in the progress manifest / DA_CACHE
                        (default).
  --no-resume           Force recompute every (window, bin, obs_mode, filter)
                        unit, ignoring the progress manifest/DA_CACHE -- alias
                        of --force for the occultation-count sweep axis.
